%p
  Our team reviewed
  %strong= @provider.name
  and needs this:
%blockquote.coordinator-message= simple_format(h(@message_text))
%p Please reply to the email below with the requested information, or contact us through the Helpdesk using the link below.
%p
  You can update the provider in Marketplace:
  = link_to @provider.name, backoffice_provider_url(@provider)
%p.center
  = mail_to @reply_email, "Reply via email", subject: "Re: #{@subject}", class: "button"
  = mail_to @helpdesk_email, "Contact Helpdesk", class: "button"
